      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just crushed a 3 hour hiit session in like crazy high humidity and i’m feeling totally wiped. my legs are cramping so bad i can barely walk and i feel super weak. i was reading about electrolyte loading for intense training and i have some potassium chloride supplements here... would it be okay to just take two large doses like 2000mg right now to quickly top off my levels and stop the cramping? i really need to recover fast.",
